{"headword":"שִׁית","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> put, set <strong>(</strong>Nö<sup>Beitr. z. Sem. Sprachwiss. 39 f.</sup>; cf. Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">שת</span> Lzb <sup>375</sup>; Ecclus <span dir=\"rtl\">שית</span> Pt. pass. <a data-ref=\"Ben Sira 31:27\" href=\"/Ben_Sira.31.27\">31:27</a> (?); v. also (Nö<sup>l.c. 41</sup>) Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܺܝܽܘܬܳܐ</span> <em>quality, appearance</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:25\" href=\"/Genesis.4.25\">Gn 4:25</a> +, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.20\">1 S 4:20</a> +, 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁ֫תָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:7\" href=\"/Psalms.8.7\">ψ 8:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁ֫תָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:8\" href=\"/Psalms.90.8\">90:8</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁתַּ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:7\" href=\"/Psalms.88.7\">88:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:9\" href=\"/Psalms.88.9\">9</a>, 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁ֫תִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:28\" href=\"/Psalms.73.28\">73:28</a> +; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָּׁ֫תוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:4\" href=\"/Exodus.33.4\">Ex 33:4</a> + 3 times, metapl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁתּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:15\" href=\"/Psalms.49.15\">ψ 49:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:9\" href=\"/Psalms.73.9\">73:9</a> (other forms not found); Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשִׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:22\" href=\"/Exodus.21.22\">Ex 21:22</a> +, juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשֵׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:33\" href=\"/Job.9.33\">Jb 9:33</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫שֶׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">Gn 30:40</a> +; 3 fs. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתְּשִׁתֵ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:16\" href=\"/Ruth.4.16\">Ru 4:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשִׁיתֵ֫מוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:10\" href=\"/Psalms.21.10\">ψ 21:10</a> +, 1 s. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשִׁתֶ֫נּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.34\">1 K 11:34</a>; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.23\">Pr 27:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁיתָ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:21\" href=\"/Psalms.9.21\">ψ 9:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:3\" href=\"/Psalms.141.3\">141:3</a>; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁ֫תִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.21\">Je 31:21</a>, etc.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.7\">Is 22:7</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁית</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:1\" href=\"/Job.30.1\">Jb 30:1</a> +; Pt. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשִׁית</span> (<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.16\">Je 13:16</a> Qr, but read Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשִׁית</span>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:1\" href=\"/Exodus.10.1\">Ex 10:1</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>put, lay</em> hand upon, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:4\" href=\"/Genesis.46.4\">Gn 46:4</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:14\" href=\"/Genesis.48.14\">48:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:17\" href=\"/Genesis.48.17\">17</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Job 9:33\" href=\"/Job.9.33\">Jb 9:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:5\" href=\"/Psalms.139.5\">ψ 139:5</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> in evil partnership, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:1\" href=\"/Exodus.23.1\">Ex 23:1</a> (E); <em>put</em> ornaments, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:4\" href=\"/Exodus.33.4\">33:4</a> (J); cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.8\">1 S 2:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.9\">Is 15:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:24\" href=\"/Job.22.24\">Jb 22:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:15\" href=\"/Ruth.3.15\">Ru 3:15</a>; <em>lay</em> child into <span dir=\"rtl\">(ב)</span> bosom <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:16\" href=\"/Ruth.4.16\">Ru 4:16</a>; <em>put</em> wisdom, ב loc., <a data-ref=\"Job 38:36\" href=\"/Job.38.36\">Jb 38:36</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.24\">Pr 26:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָשִׁית עֵצוֹת בְּנַפְשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 13:3\" href=\"/Psalms.13.3\">ψ 13:3</a>, i.e. take counsel, plan; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסִי בי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:28\" href=\"/Psalms.73.28\">ψ 73:28</a>; <em>put</em> things <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחַת רַגְלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:7\" href=\"/Psalms.8.7\">8:7</a>; <em>lay</em> (penalty) <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:22\" href=\"/Exodus.21.22\">Ex 21:22</a> (E), sin <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:11\" href=\"/Numbers.12.11\">Nu 12:11</a> (E), cf. (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר</span> = <em>where</em>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:4\" href=\"/Psalms.84.4\">ψ 84:4</a>; nearly = <em>give</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(נתן)</span>, acc. + ל pers. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:25\" href=\"/Genesis.4.25\">Gn 4:25</a> (J; explan. of name <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁת</span>), <em>appoint</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:21\" href=\"/Psalms.9.21\">ψ 9:21</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>set, station</em>, sheep <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבַדּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">Gn 30:40</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא שָׁתָם עַל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">40</a> (J); acc. pers. = <em>appoint</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <em>over</em>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:33\" href=\"/Genesis.41.33\">41:33</a> (E); <em>set</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">לָמוֹ</span> pers. (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> <strong>3 b</strong>) + ב loc. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:18\" href=\"/Psalms.73.18\">ψ 73:18</a>, so (acc.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:7\" href=\"/Psalms.88.7\">88:7</a> and (obj. pers. om.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 12:6\" href=\"/Psalms.12.6\">12:6</a>, <em>set</em> crown <span dir=\"rtl\">לְרֹאשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:4\" href=\"/Psalms.21.4\">21:4</a>, <em>set</em> one (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> partit.) <span dir=\"rtl\">לְכִסֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:11\" href=\"/Psalms.132.11\">132:11</a>; <em>set</em> pers. <em>among</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ב</span> pers.) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.29\">2 S 19:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.19\">Je 3:19</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">(עִם)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:1\" href=\"/Job.30.1\">Jb 30:1</a>; <em>set</em> watch <span dir=\"rtl\">לְפִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:3\" href=\"/Psalms.141.3\">ψ 141:3</a>, snares <span dir=\"rtl\">לִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:6\" href=\"/Psalms.140.6\">140:6</a>, enmity, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּין</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:15\" href=\"/Genesis.3.15\">Gn 3:15</a> (J); iniquities <span dir=\"rtl\">לְנֶגְדֶּ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:8\" href=\"/Psalms.90.8\">ψ 90:8</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:3\" href=\"/Psalms.101.3\">101:3</a>; <em>set, direct</em> face, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> loc. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:1\" href=\"/Numbers.24.1\">Nu 24:1</a> (J), eyes <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְטוֹת בָּאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:11\" href=\"/Psalms.17.11\">ψ 17:11</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ לֵב לְ</span> <em>set</em> one’s <em>mind to</em>, give heed, attention (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, שׂוּם\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_שׂוּם\", dir=\"rtl\">שׂוּם</a> <strong>2 b</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:23\" href=\"/Exodus.7.23\">Ex 7:23</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.20\">2 S 13:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.21\">Je 31:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:14\" href=\"/Psalms.48.14\">ψ 48:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.17\">Pr 22:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.23\">27:23</a>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:17\" href=\"/Job.7.17\">Jb 7:17</a>, abs. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.20\">1 S 4:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:11\" href=\"/Psalms.62.11\">ψ 62:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.32\">Pr 24:32</a> <em>I reflected</em>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>set, fix</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:31\" href=\"/Exodus.23.31\">Ex 23:31</a> (E; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּשִׁית לִי הֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:13\" href=\"/Job.14.13\">Jb 14:13</a> wouldst <em>fix me</em> a limit, <a data-ref=\"Job 38:11\" href=\"/Job.38.11\">38:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">וּפֹא יָשִׁית בִּגְאוֹן גַּלָּיךָ</span> De al. here <em>shall one fix</em> it [the boundary, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹק</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Job 14:10\" href=\"/Job.14.10\">10</a>] = it <em>shall be fixed</em> against, etc.: but explan. very forced: Me Kau <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשָּׁבֵר ג׳</span>, Bi Bu <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁבֹּת ג׳</span>)."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>constitute, make</em> one something, 2 acc., <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.34\">1 K 11:34</a> <em>I will make him prince</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.6\">Is 5:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.1\">26:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.6\">Je 22:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:7\" href=\"/Psalms.21.7\">ψ 21:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:7\" href=\"/Psalms.84.7\">84:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:9\" href=\"/Psalms.88.9\">88:9</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">למוֹ</span> ind. obj.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:1\" href=\"/Psalms.110.1\">110:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.12\">2 S 22:12</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:12\" href=\"/Psalms.18.12\">ψ 18:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשִׁיתֵמוֹ שֶׁ֑כֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:13\" href=\"/Psalms.21.13\">21:13</a> = <em>thou wilt make them</em> (all) <em>shoulder</em>, make them turn their back, flee (cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:41\" href=\"/Psalms.18.41\">18:41</a>); acc. + ל <em>make</em> something <em>into</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.15\">Je 2:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.3\">50:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.16\">13:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:17\" href=\"/Psalms.45.17\">ψ 45:17</a> (+ ב loc.); acc. + ב comp. <em>make</em> one <em>like</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:5\" href=\"/Hosea.2.5\">Ho 2:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.3\">Is 16:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:10\" href=\"/Psalms.21.10\">ψ 21:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:12\" href=\"/Psalms.83.12\">83:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:14\" href=\"/Psalms.83.14\">14</a>; acc. only, <em>make, prepare</em>, feast <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.39\">Je 51:39</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁת קָצִיר לָךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:11\" href=\"/Hosea.6.11\">Ho 6:11</a> (read poss. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁית</span>, pt. pass.), <em>make</em> darkness <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:20\" href=\"/Psalms.104.20\">ψ 104:20</a>; = <em>perform</em> signs, ב loc. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:1\" href=\"/Exodus.10.1\">Ex 10:1</a> (J)."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"internally trans., = <em>take one’s stand</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, שׂוּם\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_שׂוּם\", dir=\"rtl\">שִׂים</a> <strong>4 a</strong>) <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפָּרָשִׁים שֹׁת שָׁתוּ הַשָּׁ֑עְרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.7\">Is 22:7</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָֽי</span> (<em>against</em>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3:7\" href=\"/Psalms.3.7\">ψ 3:7</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">יָשִׁית מִמֶּנִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:20\" href=\"/Job.10.20\">Jb 10:20</a> (Kt; > Qr Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשִׁית</span>) is dub., <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשִׁית</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשֵׁת</span>: De <em>direct</em> (attention) <em>away from me</em>, cf. Di (ellipsis of <span dir=\"rtl\">יָד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּנִים</span>, or <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב</span>), Du (sc. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָד</span>; reads Imv.); Lag (so Bu) proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁבֹּת</span>, Siegf <span dir=\"rtl\">(יָדוֹ) יָשֵׁב</span>, 𝔊 Beer (best) <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁעֵה</span> (<a data-ref=\"Job 7:19\" href=\"/Job.7.19\">7:19</a>), with <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמֵי חֶלְדִּי</span> (𝔊 Bu Be Du) for <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמַי יחדל</span> prob. rightly."}],"num":"4."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"(or <strong>Qal</strong> pass. Ges<sup>§ 53 u</sup>), Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יוּשַׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:30\" href=\"/Exodus.21.30\">Ex 21:30</a> (E) if a ransom <em>be imposed</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָיו</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:30\" href=\"/Exodus.21.30\">30</a>."}],"form":"Hoph."}]},"rid":"BDB10178","strong_numbers":["7896","7897"],"next_hw":"שִׁית²","prev_hw":"שִׁישַׁק","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8883","8884"],"TWOT":["2380","2380a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}